@startuml
title CoDraw — Distributed Collaborative Whiteboard
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #52677D
rectangle "Browser clients\nCanvas + cluster dashboard" as UI #DBEAFE
rectangle "Python leader\nBully winner\nOrder + replicate + recover" as A #DCFCE7
rectangle "Python follower B\nForward + acknowledge + apply" as B #EFF6FF
rectangle "Python follower C\nForward + acknowledge + apply" as C #EFF6FF
artifact "Local JSONL A\nENTRY + COMMIT records" as SA #FFF7ED
artifact "Local JSONL B\nENTRY + COMMIT records" as SB #FFF7ED
artifact "Local JSONL C\nENTRY + COMMIT records" as SC #FFF7ED
UI <--> A : WebSocket
UI <--> B : WebSocket
UI <--> C : WebSocket
A <--> B : Peer HTTP RPC
A <--> C : Peer HTTP RPC
A --> SA : Persist / replay
B --> SB : Persist / replay
C --> SC : Persist / replay
note bottom
All nodes: UDP discovery, HTTP heartbeats, Bully election.
Stable view: PREPARE on all -> APPLY -> client confirmation.
Failure: pause -> elect -> reconcile history -> resume.
Trusted connected-LAN prototype; partitions unsupported.
end note
@enduml
